{"pin":"AB00838","subcodes":[{"code":"AB00838","anchor":"","first_line":"O friend! It is a long time since any news hath been received from thee. Although, earlier, a letter arrived in which thou hadst asked a question","first_line_orig":"شما بايد هوشيار باشيد و نفوس را از نفثات  خفيّه و همسات  سرّيّه محافظه نمائيد و ثابت بر ميثاق به نصّ صريح الهی  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"690","translations":[{"language":"en","lang_name":"English"}],"writing_refs":[{"type":"light","type_name":"Light of the World","language":"en","lang_name":"English"}],"refs":[{"kind":"publication","code":"MMK4#159 p.173x","source":"MMK4","locator":"159 p.173x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/SWA4/swa4-176.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMK5#099 p.081x","source":"MMK5","locator":"099 p.081x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/SWA5/swa5-84.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"NURA#64","source":"NURA","locator":"64","url":"http://bluefin.live/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/nur-i-afaq.pdf"},{"kind":"translation","code":"LOTW#64","source":"LOTW","locator":"64","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/105500030"}]}]}
